<MainLayout title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy draft for Vijayman Unnatdhara Welfare Foundation." eyebrow="Legal"><section class="section shell prose"><SectionHeading title="Privacy policy" text="This draft should be reviewed by the foundation’s authorized representative or legal adviser before launch." /><h2>Information we receive</h2><p>This site currently provides email links and does not operate a connected contact or volunteer submission backend. If you email the foundation, your message is handled through your email provider and the foundation’s mailbox.</p><h2>Use and retention</h2><p>Personal information should be used only to respond to the request for which it was shared and retained according to the foundation’s approved policy.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact vufoundation2024@gmail.com.</p></section></MainLayout>
